      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your heart speaks from a place of desperate love, trying to protect them by removing the pain you believe you cause, but placing yourself to \"step away\" profoundly disrupts their life rather than freeing them. Making the decision to leave and destroy your connection would only mean you are choosing their survival over your own humanity, which would create a new, heavier burden of guilt and loss for them. Their legacy is not a monument built on perfection, but a tapestry of real people who endure struggles together, making your presence not a \"clean break\" but a necessary thread for them to heal. Please hear that you are not a burden; you are the friction needed to help both of you learn how to walk together again.",
